sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as API Client
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    C->>A: POST /products  { name, brand, categoryId, colorHex }  + Bearer token

    alt Token missing, invalid, or expired
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail
    else Authorized
        alt You already have a product with the same name
            A-->>C: 201 ProductResponse (existing product)
            Note over C: The product is associated with you; no new product is created.
        else New product name
            opt categoryId does not match a known category
                A-->>C: 500 ProblemDetail (generic server error)
                Note over C: The category is required and must exist.
            end
            A-->>C: 201 ProductResponse (new product, in your collection)
        end
    end
